## 6. Explore.jsx
- **Path:** `c:\Users\mspau\OneDrive\Documents\GitHub\raketbase\frontend\src\pages\Explore.jsx`
- **Total Line Count:** 429 lines
- **UI Framework:** **Bootstrap 5** (grid classes `row g-4`, `col-xl-9 col-lg-8`, `btn`, `card`, `badge`, `form-range`) with custom inline styles for category pills.
- **Layout Shell:** **Spark Admin shell (`sidebar-wrapper` + `main-wrapper` + `navbar-custom`)**.
- **Obvious Issues & Redundancies:**
  - **Duplicated Sidebar:** Full sidebar markup copy-pasted directly into the file.
  - **Direct `fetch`:** Calls `fetch(`${API_BASE_URL}/jobs`)` directly rather than using `services/api.js`.
